{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>לכהן המקריב אתה וגו׳.</b> One might think to him alone — Scripture says, <b>לכל בני אהרן תהיה</b>. One might think to all of them — Scripture says, <b>לכהן המקריב</b>. How so? To the division of the day that offers it (there)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:18.595171785Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}